certainty_word(s_book_11_0046, 'certainly').
sentence(s_book_11_0047, 'book', 11, 51, 'unmarked', "A pulsar of nearly two solar masses was measured in 2010; one at roughly 2.08 followed, and another at around 2.35 after that.").
year(s_book_11_0047, 2010).
