sentence(s_book_14_0052, 'book', 14, 44, 'unmarked', "English speakers, for whom the boundary does not exist, showed no such difference.").
sentence(s_book_14_0053, 'book', 14, 46, 'unmarked', "The elegant part was the control.").
sentence(s_book_14_0054, 'book', 14, 46, 'unmarked', "Participants repeated the task while holding a string of digits in memory, and again while holding a spatial pattern in memory.").
sentence(s_book_14_0055, 'book', 14, 46, 'unmarked', "The Russian advantage vanished under the verbal load and survived the spatial one, which the authors read as the language being recruited during the discrimination itself rather than having permanently restructured perception.").
sentence(s_book_14_0056, 'book', 14, 48, 'unmarked', "And a 2020 study attempting to replicate it did not find the effect.").
