sentence(s_book_17_0048, 'book', 17, 46, 'unmarked', "Chapter 5 claims a boundary changes what the chemistry inside is subject to.").
xref(s_book_17_0048, 5).
sentence(s_book_17_0049, 'book', 17, 46, 'unmarked', "Ribozymes encapsulated in model protocells adapt faster under selection than the same sequences unencapsulated, and compartmentalization protects a cooperative replicating system from being overrun by parasitic sequences that would otherwise destroy it.").
sentence(s_book_17_0050, 'book', 17, 46, 'unmarked', "The vesicle competition described in chapter 5 is a separate result pointing the same way.").
xref(s_book_17_0050, 5).
sentence(s_book_17_0051, 'book', 17, 48, 'unmarked', "Symbolic systems show measurable retention biases.").
sentence(s_book_17_0052, 'book', 17, 48, 'unmarked', "Chapters 14 and 15 claim that what survives cultural transmission is shaped by how easily it transmits, not only by whether it is accurate or useful.").
